00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:48.420
So basically if you have
something like this podcast

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:50.790
and you send it, now you
could be like, oh, OK,

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:55.020
so at what point did we
actually say podcast?

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:56.940
