00:06:11.912 --> 00:06:12.620
AMIT PANDE: Yeah.

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:13.920
So let's take an example.

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:17.280
For broadcast industry, we
have a fully managed end

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:20.790
to end service with support
and SLAs all the way

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:23.070
