00:11:51.950 --> 00:11:54.972
Or I don't know, is there crazy
stuff that can happen in-flow?

00:11:54.972 --> 00:11:55.680
AMIT PANDE: Yeah.

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:57.910
There is also applications
through machine learning

00:11:57.910 --> 00:12:00.490
where I have seen
people using machine

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:03.550
learning to be able to
use one camera to record

00:12:03.550 --> 00:12:04.990
