00:17:36.995 --> 00:17:37.790
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Oh, yes.

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:38.340
That works super well.

00:17:38.340 --> 00:17:39.965
AMIT PANDE: And it's
similar technology

00:17:39.965 --> 00:17:42.710
that we're bringing to Google
