version of the game, where

00:24:26.030 --> 00:24:27.920
you're like, I'm
interested in touchdowns.

00:24:27.920 --> 00:24:30.080
And I'm interested in
this player, correct?

00:24:30.080 --> 00:24:33.020
You can codify the
user intentions.

00:24:33.020 --> 00:24:36.009
That's probably the start
of this creative process.

00:24:36.009 --> 00:24:37.925
And then over time, I
think there will be more

00:24:37.925 --> 00:24:39.590
